WEBVTT

00:06.208 --> 00:09.541
[The following program is a true story.]

00:09.942 --> 00:12.418
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:12.443 --> 00:13.818
[True.]

00:15.655 --> 00:21.030
[3AM - Day 3 Tet]

00:23.093 --> 00:24.548
I couldn't move.

00:26.049 --> 00:27.369
I felt paralyzed.

00:30.149 --> 00:31.233
I felt a shadow.

00:32.668 --> 00:34.314
Pulling me towards it.

00:38.164 --> 00:39.068
I...

00:39.442 --> 00:41.734
I couldn't control my body.

00:44.500 --> 00:45.386
She...

00:47.117 --> 00:49.008
She was in her underwear.

00:50.226 --> 00:52.049
Lying face down on the ground.

00:54.789 --> 00:56.568
With a helmet over her head.

01:00.195 --> 01:01.435
I couldn't see her face.

01:02.994 --> 01:04.208
But I knew...

01:04.836 --> 01:06.307
It was Mai.

01:44.586 --> 01:49.703
MISSING: EVE OF TET

01:51.523 --> 01:55.157
Episode 4: Bau

01:58.397 --> 02:00.285
- Are you ok?
- I'm ok.

02:02.687 --> 02:04.129
Try to dodge...

02:04.154 --> 02:05.086
The bumps...

02:05.111 --> 02:06.884
- They hurt.
- I will try.

02:11.625 --> 02:14.760
[2 weeks - before Tet]

02:14.785 --> 02:15.922
Ouch!

02:20.250 --> 02:21.541
Hold on, let me help you.

02:24.587 --> 02:26.306
You're weak. Stop fronting.

02:26.874 --> 02:27.832
I don't need your help.

02:28.556 --> 02:30.275
Still strong as an ox.

02:30.359 --> 02:33.500
An ox doesn't breathe like a chicken
that swallowed rubber bands.

02:33.525 --> 02:34.688
The doctor said...

02:34.713 --> 02:36.259
Forget about what the doctor said!

02:36.284 --> 02:37.615
I'm 68.

02:37.726 --> 02:39.975
Live today, die tomorrow.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.166
Nonsense!

02:41.423 --> 02:42.513
You're 68.

02:42.617 --> 02:45.516
But if you get dialysis every month
you can make it to 86.

02:45.541 --> 02:46.666
Dialysis...

02:46.691 --> 02:49.320
Would only fill a doctor's pocket.

03:01.773 --> 03:02.739
Look.

03:03.468 --> 03:05.329
If you sell this house,

03:05.500 --> 03:08.897
I bet you won't find a house
that's more run down than this!

03:10.564 --> 03:12.041
I will find money.

03:12.187 --> 03:13.478
If there's debt, I'll hide.

03:13.601 --> 03:15.698
Whatever it takes to prevent
you from dying young.

03:16.070 --> 03:19.107
Even with a damaged liver,
I'd still outlive you.

03:20.692 --> 03:22.721
Look at your veins.

03:22.898 --> 03:24.148
Destroyed.

03:24.486 --> 03:26.465
Track marks all the way
down to your foot!

03:27.171 --> 03:29.650
Just like your father.
Look at him!

03:30.429 --> 03:32.345
Like father, like son.

03:34.500 --> 03:36.295
Dying young.

03:47.115 --> 03:51.666
[1 week - before Tet]

04:20.470 --> 04:21.679
Hey, Ox-man...

04:24.460 --> 04:25.233
Uncle!

04:28.317 --> 04:29.802
Oh fuck...

04:31.726 --> 04:32.733
Uncle!

04:33.838 --> 04:35.880
Please don't die, uncle.

04:41.273 --> 04:44.095
Don't leave me, uncle.

04:46.734 --> 04:48.359
Your ancestors!

04:49.398 --> 04:52.558
Why do you always want me,
to be dead, Bau?

04:55.898 --> 04:58.148
Put your hands on your stomach
the next time you sleep!

04:58.916 --> 05:00.416
So I'd know you're still alive.

05:00.441 --> 05:01.486
Fine...

05:03.674 --> 05:05.456
Your kidneys are failing.

05:08.555 --> 05:09.923
So...

05:10.625 --> 05:12.791
Have you found a job?

05:13.375 --> 05:14.775
Or…

05:15.619 --> 05:17.536
Or did you shoot up again?

05:20.424 --> 05:22.775
Live today, die tomorrow.

05:24.617 --> 05:25.680
I know.

05:36.111 --> 05:37.195
What's up, Dan?

05:38.213 --> 05:39.055
What?

05:40.500 --> 05:41.833
Yeah, I'm free tomorrow.

05:43.720 --> 05:45.022
A transport gig?

05:45.411 --> 05:46.163
Yes.

05:46.188 --> 05:47.357
It it pays, I'm in.

05:49.231 --> 05:50.553
See you tomorrow?

05:50.984 --> 05:52.927
Ok, I'll get ready.

05:57.375 --> 05:58.558
Jackpot?

05:58.583 --> 05:59.720
Gold mine!

06:01.942 --> 06:04.609
Ow-ow! It hurts!

06:12.779 --> 06:13.541
Come up!

06:16.744 --> 06:17.816
Kidnap?

06:17.841 --> 06:19.091
Not kidnapping.

06:19.116 --> 06:21.266
Just picking her up...

06:21.291 --> 06:22.666
And hiding her somewhere.

06:23.345 --> 06:24.716
Is she going willingly?

06:24.741 --> 06:25.883
No.

06:27.416 --> 06:28.708
Then it's kidnapping!

06:30.431 --> 06:32.089
It's just for show!

06:32.492 --> 06:33.795
I just want to scare her.

06:33.820 --> 06:35.247
So she pays what she owed me.

06:35.757 --> 06:36.605
Got it.

06:37.359 --> 06:39.330
We kidnap her,
then we rough her up.

06:40.437 --> 06:41.235
No!

06:41.260 --> 06:42.177
No roughing up!

06:42.439 --> 06:43.953
And it's not HER that
we're kidnapping.

06:44.739 --> 06:45.751
The husband?

06:45.814 --> 06:46.966
What for?

06:46.991 --> 06:47.991
She hates him!

06:48.418 --> 06:49.607
The 2 kids?

06:51.187 --> 06:52.407
Just one.

06:53.179 --> 06:54.095
The eldest.

06:54.120 --> 06:54.900
Mai.

06:55.629 --> 06:56.511
How much?

07:02.124 --> 07:04.140
50 million. You and him.

07:06.372 --> 07:09.066
How much does she owe you?

07:25.562 --> 07:27.317
What the hell's wrong with you?

07:27.648 --> 07:28.356
Mai.

07:28.382 --> 07:29.420
Her mother.

07:29.445 --> 07:30.195
So what?

07:30.580 --> 07:32.161
I'm her regular buyer.

07:33.728 --> 07:35.025
Hoa, the chicken innards lady.

07:35.050 --> 07:36.508
Who doesn't buy from her?

07:42.392 --> 07:44.154
I think I'm out for this one.

07:53.530 --> 07:56.186
I think I'll drown you
at the bottom of the dam.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.936
I'll put some rocks in you...

07:59.343 --> 08:01.154
So that you'll stay there.

08:09.680 --> 08:11.426
Think of your uncle,

08:12.015 --> 08:13.634
if you need motivation.

08:15.713 --> 08:17.096
Or maybe you prefer...

08:17.121 --> 08:18.829
To burn like these coals?

08:36.880 --> 08:40.264
[12PM - New Year's Eve]

08:43.157 --> 08:45.120
I told you I don't have any chickens!

08:45.145 --> 08:47.350
- Alright? I don't have, don't need to call.
- Final Warning! If you don't...

08:49.181 --> 08:50.853
Bitch hung up on me!

08:51.750 --> 08:53.016
What the hell is that?

08:57.453 --> 08:58.731
I'm talking about this.

08:58.756 --> 08:59.834
Yours?

09:00.454 --> 09:01.704
My backup's?

09:02.617 --> 09:03.830
You two joined a circus?

09:03.855 --> 09:05.279
Is that why you're late?

09:05.554 --> 09:06.660
On our way...

09:06.685 --> 09:07.785
We got into an accident.

09:07.884 --> 09:08.981
Shut up, the two of you!

09:09.006 --> 09:10.661
Now she's not answering my calls!

09:15.734 --> 09:18.476
I told you, we don't have any!
Stop calling!

09:20.369 --> 09:21.387
You call her.

09:22.741 --> 09:24.090
- Me?
- Yes.

09:24.115 --> 09:25.263
I can't do that.

09:25.288 --> 09:26.332
Just call her.

09:26.702 --> 09:27.761
Put it on speaker.

09:27.786 --> 09:28.744
So we can hear.

09:37.750 --> 09:38.375
I told you I don't have...

09:38.400 --> 09:39.609
Don't hang up!

09:40.172 --> 09:41.284
Oh, Miss 2!

09:41.344 --> 09:42.433
You want some innards?

09:42.458 --> 09:44.808
See? She knows my voice,
the cops will know!

09:44.833 --> 09:45.391
So what?

09:45.416 --> 09:46.541
You're ordering chickens!

09:46.566 --> 09:47.208
Keep talking.

09:47.250 --> 09:48.000
Forget it!

09:49.437 --> 09:50.500
How much...

09:52.158 --> 09:54.509
The bastard hung up...

09:58.531 --> 10:00.459
Bau and I will head
to the abandoned house.

10:00.484 --> 10:02.125
When you've made up your mind
about the kidnapping,

10:02.322 --> 10:03.350
call me.

10:03.541 --> 10:04.208
The rest...

10:04.250 --> 10:05.083
I'll handle.

10:07.166 --> 10:11.416
[5:15PM - New Year's Eve]

10:35.309 --> 10:36.287
Hello?

10:36.312 --> 10:38.135
I'm here to deliver chickens.

10:38.515 --> 10:40.593
I'm standing by a wooden shed,

10:40.859 --> 10:43.551
but it looks deserted.

10:44.039 --> 10:45.662
It's next to a dirt road.

10:45.687 --> 10:47.386
Is this the right address?

10:47.530 --> 10:49.385
Yes. Can you see me waving?

10:50.430 --> 10:51.264
Okay.

10:51.679 --> 10:52.389
Okay.

10:52.500 --> 10:53.389
Keep going.

10:53.414 --> 10:54.536
Ok, I will.

10:56.687 --> 10:58.170
Go straight in!

10:58.210 --> 10:59.250
Come on in!

10:59.343 --> 11:01.462
Don't worry! I got the money!

11:01.487 --> 11:02.536
Quickly!

11:03.017 --> 11:03.990
Okay!

11:09.625 --> 11:10.250
Dan!

11:10.750 --> 11:11.416
Dan!

11:13.710 --> 11:14.585
Dan!

11:23.118 --> 11:24.243
Where are you, Dan?

11:25.507 --> 11:26.680
She's here!

11:35.666 --> 11:37.428
Stop here!

11:38.445 --> 11:39.233
God.

11:39.447 --> 11:41.225
That's good! Stop here!

11:41.320 --> 11:42.710
Let me help you.

11:45.375 --> 11:46.458
Lucky!

11:46.585 --> 11:48.797
You still deliver chickens
on New Year's Eve!

11:50.913 --> 11:52.054
Hey.

11:52.703 --> 11:54.756
I'll have to see the money
before you can have the chickens.

11:54.781 --> 11:57.824
The money's here.
Gotta see the chickens first.

12:00.609 --> 12:02.372
Do you really have the money?

12:05.611 --> 12:07.150
Go Home, I got no money.

12:07.175 --> 12:07.944
Go.

12:08.875 --> 12:10.511
Go home! I got no money!

12:11.486 --> 12:12.600
Where are you going?

12:12.625 --> 12:13.731
What is this place?

12:13.756 --> 12:15.148
I got no money!

12:17.375 --> 12:18.590
Go home!

12:19.328 --> 12:20.578
This is...

12:32.141 --> 12:33.423
You tricked me, right?

12:34.007 --> 12:36.125
- Is there anyone here? Somebody here?
- No, I don't...

12:36.125 --> 12:37.182
Don't scream!

12:37.569 --> 12:40.475
- Is there anyone here? You tricked me, right?
- Don't scream! I don't do anything.

12:40.500 --> 12:42.629
- Is there anybody here? Is there...?
- Come on!

12:44.414 --> 12:45.273
Let me go!

12:47.156 --> 12:48.474
You grab her legs!

12:52.390 --> 12:53.834
You bitch!

13:34.930 --> 13:36.386
Here's her stuff.

13:36.984 --> 13:37.998
What now?

13:39.351 --> 13:40.434
What were you doing?

13:40.681 --> 13:41.723
Why are you standing there?

13:42.720 --> 13:43.947
Go dump the bike!

13:43.972 --> 13:45.139
You're not coming with me?

13:47.579 --> 13:48.583
Idiot.

13:49.062 --> 13:50.533
This big fucking truck.

13:50.882 --> 13:52.268
Us fumbling around?

13:52.491 --> 13:53.757
We'll draw attention.

13:53.782 --> 13:54.948
You wanna get caught?

13:56.827 --> 13:57.835
But...

13:57.875 --> 13:58.717
Go!

13:59.250 --> 14:00.476
- Go quickly!
- But...

14:15.734 --> 14:19.387
[8AM - Day 3 Tet]

14:19.412 --> 14:21.895
The missing girl
H.T.M's corpse is being carried out.

14:21.920 --> 14:25.378
After three days of being
reported missing, then kidnapped...

14:25.739 --> 14:29.382
- A most shocking turn of event has happened!
- Everybody go home!

14:29.407 --> 14:31.682
- Let me go! I need to see Mai!
- Auntie! Uncle, please!

14:31.707 --> 14:32.831
- My daughter is in there!
- Uncle!

14:32.856 --> 14:33.917
Let me go!

14:33.942 --> 14:36.514
Right now, the missing girl
H.T.M's corpse is being carried out.

14:36.539 --> 14:39.792
I cannot imagine what she must have
gone through the past three days!

14:39.817 --> 14:41.608
The police are actively
investigating the case.

14:41.633 --> 14:44.217
More to come with this case
on the GLX network!

14:44.245 --> 14:46.403
We hope you will all stay tuned.

14:46.428 --> 14:47.489
Mai!

14:47.514 --> 14:48.605
- Mai!
- No!

14:48.630 --> 14:50.107
Mai!

14:50.132 --> 14:52.412
- Please, calm down, Auntie.
- Mai!

14:52.437 --> 14:53.340
Listen to me, Auntie!

14:53.365 --> 14:56.944
- Mai!
- Please calm down, Auntie!

14:57.239 --> 14:59.489
Mai!

14:59.534 --> 15:02.478
You two... don't film it.

15:03.497 --> 15:06.004
Mother, calm down, please!

15:06.200 --> 15:08.487
- Mother, calm down.
- Where do you go, Miss Hoa?

15:10.754 --> 15:12.634
Calm down, please.

15:12.659 --> 15:14.661
Can I interview you for something?

15:15.220 --> 15:16.075
Mother!

15:16.195 --> 15:18.375
- Where are you going?
- Miss Hoa, Miss Hoa!

15:18.400 --> 15:20.077
- Mother, where are you going?
- Don't film it!

15:27.093 --> 15:28.533
Mai!

15:28.656 --> 15:30.322
Mom...

15:31.390 --> 15:33.739
My big sister!

15:38.898 --> 15:41.177
- Mom!
- Auntie!

15:41.293 --> 15:42.547
- Mom!
- Auntie!

15:42.572 --> 15:46.976
- Mom! Mai...
- Auntie! What's happened to Mai?

15:47.001 --> 15:52.127
- Auntie! What's going on? Auntie!
- Mom!

15:52.152 --> 15:55.692
- Auntie!
- Mai!

15:55.796 --> 15:57.296
Get off of me!

16:01.791 --> 16:04.343
- Auntie! What are you doing?
- Mom! What are you doing?

16:04.368 --> 16:07.401
Auntie please don't! You're scaring Hanh!

16:10.337 --> 16:11.141
Stay away!

16:11.166 --> 16:12.353
- Auntie!
- Mom!

16:12.378 --> 16:13.600
- Auntie!
- Move away!

16:13.625 --> 16:15.684
Auntie, put the knife down, please!

16:15.709 --> 16:19.159
Auntie please listen to me
and put the knife down!

16:19.184 --> 16:20.771
- Mom, calm down!
- Auntie!

16:20.796 --> 16:21.659
Move away!

16:21.691 --> 16:23.766
- Please calm down, Auntie!
- Please calm down, mom!

16:23.791 --> 16:25.977
- Please calm down, Auntie!
- Mom!

16:26.258 --> 16:27.365
Back off!

16:31.624 --> 16:35.387
- Auntie! Auntie!
- Mom!

16:35.414 --> 16:37.907
- Auntie! Please calm down!
- Mom!

16:37.932 --> 16:42.242
- Auntie!
- Mom!

16:44.843 --> 16:47.718
Dad! Why didn't you
come home with Mom?

16:49.125 --> 16:51.625
Mom went away with a knife!

17:21.218 --> 17:22.237
You dog!

17:22.262 --> 17:23.702
Come out at once!

17:25.179 --> 17:26.303
Come out here!

17:26.665 --> 17:28.638
Where are you, Co?

17:30.029 --> 17:31.013
Fuck you!

17:32.624 --> 17:34.699
You dog! Get out here!

17:37.692 --> 17:40.048
Come out! I know you're in there!

17:40.073 --> 17:41.526
I see your feet!

17:42.618 --> 17:43.795
Fuck you!

17:43.845 --> 17:45.154
You killed my girl!

17:45.179 --> 17:47.467
Even if the sky falls,
I will still end you!

17:49.572 --> 17:50.605
You come out here!

17:51.174 --> 17:52.726
Or I'll smash this door!

17:53.130 --> 17:53.850
Dream on!

17:53.875 --> 17:54.958
I dare you!

17:55.375 --> 17:56.125
Smash away!

17:56.150 --> 17:57.232
You daring me?

17:57.257 --> 17:58.500
Pound all your life,

17:58.525 --> 17:59.579
you can not getting in!

17:59.604 --> 18:00.600
Fuck you!

18:01.103 --> 18:02.466
You better hide!

18:02.491 --> 18:04.116
Come out and I'll spill your guts!

18:40.906 --> 18:41.652
Hoa!

18:41.677 --> 18:42.936
Hoa! Please don't kill me!

18:42.961 --> 18:44.827
We had a deal, remember?

18:49.843 --> 18:51.164
My daughter is dead!

18:51.189 --> 18:52.960
There is no fucking deal!

18:53.898 --> 18:54.812
Hoa!

18:55.094 --> 18:56.288
I didn't do it!

18:56.562 --> 18:57.932
Hoa, don't kill me!

18:58.450 --> 18:59.516
It's fucker Dan!

18:59.541 --> 19:00.911
Him and his goons did it!

19:01.142 --> 19:02.616
I can't stop them!

19:02.641 --> 19:04.178
I didn't do it! Don't kill me!

19:04.203 --> 19:06.196
It's them who killed Mai! Hoa!

19:15.179 --> 19:16.220
Doctor...

19:17.453 --> 19:20.399
Can you please not cut
into my daughter?

19:22.095 --> 19:23.346
If you do...

19:23.672 --> 19:25.583
Then her soul won't be able to move on.

19:30.499 --> 19:31.980
I know that you loved Mai.

19:32.726 --> 19:34.117
If you wish,

19:34.142 --> 19:36.310
I will tell the coroner,
not to operate on her.

19:38.228 --> 19:40.620
But we still need to do an autopsy.

19:42.220 --> 19:44.095
Because it's part of the case,

19:44.470 --> 19:46.184
to find out who killed Mai.

19:50.375 --> 19:54.512
How can one night...
Turn everything upside down?

19:57.609 --> 19:58.695
Yesterday...

19:59.401 --> 20:00.927
I thought that...

20:01.447 --> 20:03.152
I would still see her again.

20:05.390 --> 20:06.568
How so?

20:13.875 --> 20:18.250
[7PM - Day 2 Tet]

20:21.875 --> 20:22.742
Vinh!

20:24.269 --> 20:25.624
You owe me 500k!

20:27.181 --> 20:28.015
For what?

20:29.172 --> 20:31.005
You promised that
I'd be able to see my daughter.

20:31.283 --> 20:32.228
You lied!

20:37.728 --> 20:40.603
Just knowing the location of the bike,
doesn't mean it is where you'll find Mai.

20:40.628 --> 20:41.920
What if the kidnappers

20:42.017 --> 20:43.766
took her across the border?

20:45.131 --> 20:47.006
Then you should take this cage over there,

20:48.031 --> 20:49.508
and ask for their money!

20:53.146 --> 20:53.916
Vinh...

20:54.000 --> 20:55.041
What do you want?

20:55.166 --> 20:56.250
Wanna rob me?

20:57.830 --> 21:00.280
If I can convince the kidnappers
to return Mai...

21:01.296 --> 21:03.280
Will you agree to pay me 50 mil?

21:06.141 --> 21:08.281
I don't have time for your games!

21:08.306 --> 21:10.199
Find someone else to get
your drug money!

21:10.224 --> 21:11.631
Stop tormenting me!

21:14.322 --> 21:16.114
It's not for me...

21:18.041 --> 21:20.041
My uncle's kidneys have failed.

21:21.908 --> 21:24.175
If he doesn't get dialysis
in the next two days,

21:25.094 --> 21:26.332
He'll die.

21:34.288 --> 21:35.079
Uncle Vinh!

21:37.229 --> 21:39.155
If I bring your chick back to her coop,

21:41.203 --> 21:42.828
will you pay me?

21:50.133 --> 21:51.549
Your aunt was right.

21:52.671 --> 21:54.629
He was nothing but a junkie.

21:55.601 --> 21:57.344
He just want to get money!

21:59.275 --> 22:01.272
Why didn't you tell me this sooner, uncle?

22:05.381 --> 22:07.233
What does it matter now?

22:09.109 --> 22:11.859
Either way... Mai is still dead.

22:14.259 --> 22:15.530
I shouldn't have...

22:15.828 --> 22:18.036
Wasted so much time with Bau!

22:18.671 --> 22:20.671
I should been looking for Mai.

22:21.031 --> 22:21.881
Uncle...

22:21.906 --> 22:24.266
Tell me everything that
you've discussed with Bau,

22:24.291 --> 22:25.541
from the beginning.

22:36.625 --> 22:40.750
[5:30PM - New Year's Eve]

22:42.400 --> 22:43.433
Are you done?

22:43.458 --> 22:44.417
God damn it!

22:46.357 --> 22:47.319
Quickly!

22:49.625 --> 22:50.577
Have you done?

22:52.500 --> 22:53.250
Damn it!

22:53.473 --> 22:54.648
Have you done yet?

22:55.390 --> 22:56.364
Quickly!

23:00.117 --> 23:01.215
Quickly!

23:10.406 --> 23:11.657
Have you got rid of it?

23:11.682 --> 23:13.357
I sent it to Atlantis!

23:13.387 --> 23:15.082
Only Poseidon can find it now!

23:17.069 --> 23:18.551
Uh, where is she?

23:20.469 --> 23:22.788
Is that your problem, stupid?

23:25.791 --> 23:29.625
[4PM - Day 3 Tet]

23:39.320 --> 23:40.989
What's going on?

23:45.974 --> 23:46.976
You're awake.

23:47.242 --> 23:48.212
Save your strength.

23:48.237 --> 23:49.356
We need to hideout.

23:49.866 --> 23:51.027
Bau.

23:53.335 --> 23:56.155
What have you done now?

23:56.740 --> 23:57.984
Quickly while we still have time.

23:58.009 --> 23:59.725
I've packed your things.

23:59.750 --> 24:01.077
Not much time left!

24:01.102 --> 24:02.041
Go where?

24:02.531 --> 24:04.322
This is my house.

24:05.351 --> 24:06.981
People will come looking for me.

24:07.478 --> 24:08.475
If I leave,

24:08.500 --> 24:10.125
there is noone gonna take care of you.

24:10.570 --> 24:13.028
You're the one who needs taking care of.

24:14.431 --> 24:17.348
- I'm a dead man.
- Dead, my ass!

24:17.986 --> 24:19.497
I told you that I'll find us money.

24:20.291 --> 24:21.250
Worst case...

24:22.125 --> 24:23.235
I'll sell my kidney!

24:23.437 --> 24:25.067
Who would buy it?

24:25.447 --> 24:26.989
You're a junkie.

24:27.336 --> 24:29.669
All your organs are toxic.

24:31.689 --> 24:33.564
Your body is worthless!

24:37.258 --> 24:38.924
It's fine.

24:40.023 --> 24:41.314
It's alright.

24:43.984 --> 24:47.056
My father was buried out there.

24:47.992 --> 24:50.325
Your father's buried out back.

24:51.142 --> 24:55.226
When my time comes,
I'll be buried out there, too.

24:56.432 --> 24:57.891
Folks like us,

24:58.163 --> 25:01.306
Have no chance of escaping this place.

25:02.062 --> 25:04.771
Three generations, all buried here.

25:08.000 --> 25:09.208
Live today...

25:09.625 --> 25:10.593
Die...

25:15.475 --> 25:16.183
Uncle Man?

25:17.126 --> 25:18.239
Uncle Man.

25:19.461 --> 25:20.473
Uncle Man?

26:17.187 --> 26:18.463
Mom...

26:22.344 --> 26:24.468
What's wrong with your hand?

26:25.218 --> 26:26.515
It's nothing.

26:26.640 --> 26:28.986
I got in a small accident.
I'm okay.

26:29.476 --> 26:30.869
Come here.

26:34.532 --> 26:35.820
I'm okay.

26:36.929 --> 26:38.320
Don't be scared.

26:40.189 --> 26:42.043
Don't be scared. I'm alright.

26:44.637 --> 26:46.096
Your cut...

26:46.742 --> 26:50.068
Does it have something
to do with our secret?

26:54.516 --> 26:56.932
Don't be scared. It's alright.

26:59.103 --> 27:01.020
I'm so sorry, honey.

27:01.890 --> 27:03.969
I shouldn't have left you.

27:09.703 --> 27:11.244
I'm sorry.

27:13.226 --> 27:15.802
I couldn't save your sister.

27:17.329 --> 27:20.413
I will make them all pay.

27:22.124 --> 27:23.374
I promise you.

27:29.882 --> 27:32.421
Your brother raised me since I was small.

27:33.547 --> 27:35.172
Please bless him.

27:35.278 --> 27:36.708
Help him get well...

28:16.476 --> 28:17.970
Hang in there,

28:18.156 --> 28:19.324
Ox-man.

28:19.552 --> 28:20.860
Wait for me.

28:36.219 --> 28:37.107
Bau!

28:39.595 --> 28:40.301
Stop!

28:44.954 --> 28:45.774
Stop there!

28:46.391 --> 28:47.171
Stop!

28:49.007 --> 28:50.487
You're under arrest!

28:50.512 --> 28:52.525
For the suspected murder of Mai!

28:53.750 --> 28:54.738
Ouch!

28:57.173 --> 28:57.965
Take it out!

29:07.945 --> 29:08.781
Look at it!

29:08.806 --> 29:09.728
It's not me!

29:09.753 --> 29:11.903
- Look carefully!
- I'm not the killer!

29:11.928 --> 29:13.888
- Still denying it?
- I didn't kill her!

29:14.219 --> 29:15.219
Confess!

29:15.244 --> 29:17.174
- It's not me!
- Stand up!

29:17.986 --> 29:20.583
Mai's clothing was found
on your property.

29:20.608 --> 29:22.751
Your blood is probably
smeared all over them.

29:23.359 --> 29:26.070
The cage has your fingerprints all over it.

29:26.859 --> 29:28.279
That's not all.

29:28.548 --> 29:30.309
The victim's father said...

29:30.334 --> 29:32.782
That you extorted money from him?

29:32.807 --> 29:34.766
He can testitfy to that.

29:39.353 --> 29:40.478
Disgusting.

29:40.837 --> 29:41.962
What's with the spitting?

29:43.158 --> 29:44.234
Confess!

29:44.259 --> 29:45.472
I've already said it.

29:45.656 --> 29:46.769
I'm innocent.

29:48.658 --> 29:50.510
What about the cage?

29:50.656 --> 29:51.614
I found it.

29:51.994 --> 29:53.453
What about Mai's clothes?

29:59.976 --> 30:01.744
Someone put it there.

30:01.791 --> 30:03.592
I've never seen them before.

30:04.431 --> 30:05.515
Besides...

30:06.156 --> 30:07.753
You have no proof.

30:08.351 --> 30:09.809
That I had put them there.

30:15.749 --> 30:20.225
We can only book him for
attempted extortion, not for murder.

30:20.250 --> 30:23.102
What's this about you assaulting
him during the arrest, huh?

30:23.127 --> 30:24.641
He tried to run,

30:24.666 --> 30:26.041
then resisted arrest.

30:26.077 --> 30:27.535
He hit me first!

30:27.922 --> 30:29.737
You're not a five year old child!

30:30.132 --> 30:31.418
You're a police officer.

30:31.665 --> 30:32.540
More over,

30:32.751 --> 30:34.899
have not to mention your aunt.

30:35.077 --> 30:38.868
How much negative image
has she brought to our department?

30:39.250 --> 30:40.458
I'm sorry, sir.

30:40.804 --> 30:42.340
What is my directive?

30:43.109 --> 30:44.945
Keep doing your job!

30:45.374 --> 30:46.411
From the start,

30:46.851 --> 30:48.684
you had reasons to arrest him.

30:49.173 --> 30:51.003
Continue your investigation.

30:51.056 --> 30:53.625
But if you can't get his confession,

30:53.650 --> 30:55.108
then you have to let him go.

30:55.376 --> 30:57.668
Either way, we need to wrap up this case.

30:58.398 --> 31:00.189
Put all this ugliness behind us.

31:05.150 --> 31:06.975
Let me go! I want to see him!

31:07.000 --> 31:08.166
He killed my daughter!

31:08.191 --> 31:10.489
We don't have enough evidence!

31:10.500 --> 31:11.375
What about the chicken cage?

31:11.400 --> 31:13.016
He knew the kidnappers!

31:13.041 --> 31:15.124
He said that he could bring Mai back!

31:15.125 --> 31:15.562
Right!

31:15.587 --> 31:16.868
Please, you two...

31:16.916 --> 31:21.389
We're doing our best.
We're not dragging our feet.

31:21.414 --> 31:22.778
What have you done lately?

31:22.803 --> 31:24.108
Auntie! Listen to me.

31:24.133 --> 31:25.133
I will not listen!

31:25.133 --> 31:25.967
Let me see him!

31:25.967 --> 31:27.383
- Auntie! Listen to me. Calm down!
- Quickly!

31:27.408 --> 31:28.649
- I want to meet him!
- Please go outside.

31:28.674 --> 31:30.585
- Listen to me. Calm down. Uncle!
- He's helping the kidnappers!

31:30.610 --> 31:32.592
- Mai's killed because of him!
- Auntie! Outside!

31:32.617 --> 31:33.953
- Please get outside, auntie!
- Long!

31:33.978 --> 31:35.926
- Let's go outside and talk!
- I want to meet him.

31:38.131 --> 31:39.387
I'm sorry.

31:39.878 --> 31:41.293
But you need to listen to me.

31:41.318 --> 31:43.495
All the evidence we have
against him is circumstantial.

31:43.520 --> 31:44.597
So what?

31:44.717 --> 31:47.614
I'm sure of it! He killed your cousin!

31:47.826 --> 31:50.953
You are useless if you cannot see that!

31:52.063 --> 31:52.858
Mother!

31:52.883 --> 31:54.094
- Auntie!
- Mother!

31:55.258 --> 31:56.244
Move away!

32:03.302 --> 32:04.819
She is coming down.

32:05.195 --> 32:06.786
- Please.
- Miss Hoa!

32:11.008 --> 32:12.050
Yesterday,

32:12.075 --> 32:13.575
she lost control.

32:14.654 --> 32:15.612
Long...

32:16.063 --> 32:17.730
Please make it right for her.

32:18.815 --> 32:19.792
I will.

32:20.819 --> 32:22.838
And you, please keep her calm.

32:23.320 --> 32:24.931
I need to follow protocol.

32:26.836 --> 32:27.545
There!

32:28.920 --> 32:32.621
You said the same thing when she
first told you that Mai was missing.

32:34.693 --> 32:36.396
I know your auntie is right.

32:36.860 --> 32:38.402
She has always been right.

32:38.484 --> 32:40.258
She knew about everything!

32:40.283 --> 32:41.768
But none of us listened!

32:46.764 --> 32:48.065
I'm sorry.

32:49.076 --> 32:50.617
Don't say you're sorry.

32:51.350 --> 32:54.419
Now you're auntil will do
everything she can...

32:54.444 --> 32:56.444
to find out why Mai was murdered.

33:04.670 --> 33:07.094
How long are you planning
on keeping me here?

33:08.272 --> 33:10.134
Please let me go.

33:11.670 --> 33:13.211
Can we keep him here forever?

33:14.297 --> 33:17.408
We have another suspect.
You two take his statement.

33:17.433 --> 33:18.713
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

33:33.672 --> 33:34.943
Let's start again.

33:36.014 --> 33:36.956
With the truth.

33:47.312 --> 33:48.848
The suspect has confessed.

33:48.873 --> 33:51.680
- The case is closed. Thank you.
- Thank you, sir!

33:53.150 --> 33:55.768
What a satisfying conclusion
for the Missing Chicken Vendor case.

33:55.894 --> 33:57.658
Police captain Tran Cong Quoc,

33:57.683 --> 34:00.237
has just announced
the full confession of Nguyen Chau Bau,

34:00.262 --> 34:02.884
for the kidnapping
and murder of miss H.T.M.

34:03.095 --> 34:03.962
Hey!

34:04.088 --> 34:05.399
They caught the killer!

34:05.655 --> 34:08.147
Finally, can we stop watching?

34:08.383 --> 34:09.467
Jackpot!

34:09.492 --> 34:11.186
Double payment!

34:11.211 --> 34:13.753
More details will be
revealed during the trial.

34:13.778 --> 34:16.153
For now the exciting chapter 
of the Missing Chicken Vendor case

34:16.177 --> 34:18.118
has reach another unexpected twist.

34:18.143 --> 34:21.304
Tune in when the trial begins and justice
will be served. Join us on the GLX channel.

34:21.329 --> 34:23.322
- Thank you, everyone...
- Where is this justice?

34:23.347 --> 34:24.786
When the killer is still out there!

34:24.811 --> 34:28.066
Nguyen Chau Bau is a junkie, how could he
be the killer? He can barely walk straight!

34:28.115 --> 34:30.991
Anyone who thinks that he can
do this alone should think again!

34:31.016 --> 34:32.602
I swear to you, it’s not over!

34:32.627 --> 34:35.572
I will continue to search for the
killers until they are all behind bars!

34:35.782 --> 34:37.466
Miss Hoa! What is it happend?

34:37.467 --> 34:38.882
Miss Hoa! What do you mean by that?

34:38.883 --> 34:40.341
Miss Hoa! Miss Hoa!

34:40.451 --> 34:42.834
Miss Hoa! Miss Hoa!

34:48.765 --> 34:49.712
Dan.

34:49.737 --> 34:50.362
Co?

34:50.387 --> 34:51.586
You're still alive?

34:51.662 --> 34:53.688
I thought you were a dead man.

34:54.355 --> 34:55.730
She burned my house down.

34:55.898 --> 34:57.772
But I'm back from the ashes.

34:57.995 --> 34:59.258
How did you get out?

34:59.701 --> 35:01.077
You wanna know that?

35:01.154 --> 35:04.612
Or do you wanna know how we can
make 500 mill every month?

35:05.404 --> 35:06.460
Follow me, Dan.

35:06.599 --> 35:08.057
We're gonna be filthy rich!

35:28.975 --> 35:30.733
MISSING: EVE OF TET
